    "en": {
      "trackName": "ZEN Tile Flow: Pipe Puzzle",
      "description": "ZEN Tile Flow is a calm pipe-connection puzzle game built for quick sessions.\n\nRotate and mirror glowing tiles to connect the twin stars. Early levels are quick and relaxing, while Perfect Flow challenges ask you to use every tile on the board. As you progress, larger deep-flow puzzles add more thoughtful paths while staying easy to read and play.\n\nFeatures:\n- Apple Watch-first puzzle play\n- Simple tap and long-press tile controls\n- Perfect Flow levels that use every tile\n- Deep logic boards built for short sessions\n- Relaxing neon visuals, sound, and haptics\n- Progress tracking and replay\n- Offline play with local progress storage\n- Music, sound, motion, and contrast controls\n\nNo account. No ads. Just a focused logic puzzle you can play in quiet moments.",
      "releaseNotes": "Completion juice — chime, 15 varied praise lines, richer milestones, milestone ray-burst + haptic\nProminent RESUME GAME button\nDigital Crown scrolling fixed\nInstant taps (single = CW, double = two CW)\nSim-only debug Pro unlock",
